{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "b8a793d6861396395d48a8a4eee39c9e37e3f4e3bc506fd7cd3f5c391bdfade7", "ja": "また、あした", "zh": "明天见", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e69ec6b25f7338487ec68072ac15b98f117be7acf1150ba56647f6426a2e09a0", "ja": "劇場に戻り、きちんとまつりへ謝ることが\nできた翼。無事に仲直りもでき、まつりが\n冗談を言うなど、いつもの賑やかさが戻って\nきた。明日を約束しそれぞれ家路につく中、\n翼は仲間という絆のすごさを再確認する。", "zh": "回到剧场后，翼终于好好地向茉莉道了歉。\n两人顺利和好，茉莉还开起了玩笑，往日的热闹也\n回来了。两人约定明天再见，分别踏上回家的路，\n翼再次感受到伙伴之间羁绊的强大。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9eacba27f302795037f0db7e8ef5bd43b3030acb4bbfbd8beda443216d3361a6", "ja": "（翼と一緒に劇場へと戻ると、みんなが待っていた。\n貴音、恵美。そしてもちろん、まつりもだ）", "zh": "（和翼一起回到剧场时，大家都在等着。贵音、惠美，当然还有祭。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_06_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "ed70e08900548b1b9c9ac3789becf144d3cd6b4d90144249d577b4465f11fafe", "ja": "まつりさん……ごめんなさいっ！", "zh": "茉莉前辈……对不起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_06_1002_016tsu", "source_sha256": "736d17c9214f86558564fc858efcdf262b76db6c22d6d98f8e706c05a4b6dea8", "ja": "わたし、まつりさんにひどいこと言っちゃって、\nそれで……えっと……。", "zh": "我对小祭说了很过分的话，\n所以……那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_06_1003_021mat", "source_sha256": "376dde6dfebd6a7022a524c0e527639857f45191a5eb3cd077ad99fecff36d62", "ja": "翼ちゃんに、「大っ嫌い！」って言われ\nちゃったのです……姫、うるうるなのです……。", "zh": "被小翼说了“最讨厌你了！”  \n……姬都眼泪汪汪了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_06_1004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "25aef470946245a5d59cd7386dcb71b70a67d4a00b33579813b6a9b454c9c6d7", "ja": "そんなの、ウソだから！\nまつりさんのこと、嫌いなわけないもん！", "zh": "那是骗人的啦！\n我怎么可能会讨厌茉莉小姐嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_06_1005_021mat", "source_sha256": "932087df936bca3664a680d81e4154eba8584c710f1cf4a5bde2dcffd34dfbbe", "ja": "うるうる……。\nそれは本当なのです……？", "zh": "泪眼汪汪……  \n那是真的吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_06_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "00eaf70656e651524d210a956068d91f9a6646a3a4f278f0a6f5df1b6861bd98", "ja": "本当に本当っ！\nわたし、まつりさんのこと大好き！", "zh": "真的真的！\n我最喜欢茉莉姐姐了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_06_1007_021mat", "source_sha256": "657ec4a13a82b6cc23e7ddb7dfa71a7fd1cf064ebd12a1f340fa48e49d20ff45", "ja": "なら……行動で示して欲しいのです♪", "zh": "那么……希望你能用行动来证明♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_06_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c6694e214fcbf90323d70195b1d433659320f51475da65797611484ac09e9d33", "ja": "え？　行動って……。", "zh": "诶？行动是指……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_06_1009_021mat", "source_sha256": "c3714d12400a43403f88fe449dbb6f63122882b5abc7f354308d9388adccc305", "ja": "たとえば……翼ちゃんから姫に、\n仲直りのキスをする、とか？", "zh": "比如说……让翼给姬一个和好的吻之类的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_06_1010_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c7b3ba91da6ca56d175234889acd8525cd7254b439d13283fedf1c957496798e", "ja": "ええ～～～！？　き、キスって、そんな……！", "zh": "诶诶～～～！？　亲、亲吻什么的，这也太……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_06_1011_021mat", "source_sha256": "7debc581eaed79f4019a440482bcd4706f1cce8bd516c86e49b07596e7f15a83", "ja": "ふふっ。冗談ですよ、翼ちゃん。\n姫から翼ちゃんへ、ウソのお返しなのです♪", "zh": "嘻嘻，是开玩笑啦，小翼。  \n这是公主给小翼的谎言回礼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_06_1012_016tsu", "source_sha256": "3a6bda77bf02d2be7a180a220e1d0eb5071bfdf587347ffaceccbaca786caa80", "ja": "え、ウソ？　……もー！\n一瞬、本気にしちゃったじゃないですかー！", "zh": "诶，骗人的？……真是的！\n我刚才一瞬间都当真了啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_06_1013_021mat", "source_sha256": "2888ac71a93ef8b91f6b47504b6902a3d8d643dc169fe49948d2eb4060c53c11", "ja": "ごめんなさい、なのです。\nでも照れる翼ちゃんも、らぶりー！なのです～。", "zh": "对不起哦。不过，害羞的翼也很可爱哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_06_1014_p", "source_sha256": "cfec18ac8710a61cabfc73388442cf95c21ff4e4be9aa92bc1707ace986c9fb6", "ja": "やれやれ。これで一件落着かな。\n何はともあれ、仲直りできて良かったな。", "zh": "哎呀哎呀。这样总算是告一段落了吧。\n不管怎么说，能重归于好真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_06_1015_008tak", "source_sha256": "2db2b71dacc7c79e03e20a8c7409d5109ef17d31eec88ba8f897478bdfccd803", "ja": "そうですね。良い落とし所かと。", "zh": "是啊，我觉得这样算是个不错的收场。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_06_1016_008tak", "source_sha256": "00b2b37338d45381010878985fae1213c0b24496ab5fe6df07c93c255d066d2b", "ja": "{$P$}。色々とご助力\nいただきまして、ありがとうございました。", "zh": "{$P$}。感谢您给予的诸多帮助。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_06_1017_p", "source_sha256": "0b963ddc053f384aa0f65512ae513b0e6f7c5f92bde83500545cad3dc85604a0", "ja": "いや、俺は何もしてないよ。\n最後は、自分達でしっかり解決できたしな。", "zh": "不，我什么都没做。\n最后还是你们自己好好解决了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_06_1018_020meg", "source_sha256": "61075b6c7f5fc9d4de8a36f87f05b4baab8e8a57e9fed2bd988b093e0cef0cc1", "ja": "いや～、それにしてもホント、\n翼もまつりも手がかかるよね～。にゃはは♪", "zh": "哎呀——话说回来，翼和茉莉还真是让人操心啊——。喵哈哈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_06_1019_021mat", "source_sha256": "85435dbc2e3a3d220e27158c86eee0aef935edcabfd9f3f5158274ccb5cd0a3a", "ja": "ほ……？\n恵美ちゃん、それは聞き捨てならないのです。", "zh": "哦……？惠美，这话我可不能当没听见哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_06_1020_020meg", "source_sha256": "b5feeaeff56eaba7fab12fcf866607f9eeb1dfcd2bac8d2eb1e2a35b9c59251d", "ja": "お、なになに？　文句ある？", "zh": "哦，怎么了怎么了？有意见吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_06_1021_016tsu", "source_sha256": "428bcba29cac2d6b7b664078dae77aec61490c62365a3230fa46e15fe63429e2", "ja": "そうですよ～！　わたしだって、\n絶対お子ちゃま組なんて入らないですからね！", "zh": "就是嘛～！我也绝对不会加入小孩子组的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_06_1022_p", "source_sha256": "b719a8c9bc49b006191c4781e724e7cba7e45c9b5b9b9a5a25991a90263252ed", "ja": "こらこら、やめないか。せっかく仲直りしたのに、\nまたケンカするつもりか？", "zh": "喂喂，别闹了。好不容易才和好，难道又想吵架吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_06_1023_p", "source_sha256": "02594a3f17d75c67ada8e4ad88789c7f2d2e6d17a449a3a3c76d2fc32f7a4930", "ja": "それより、すっかり遅くなっちゃったな。\nみんな、そろそろ帰らなくていいのか？", "zh": "比起那个，已经很晚了。\n大家是不是也该差不多回去了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_06_1024_020meg", "source_sha256": "e8cbba03d410cbc28715b5d73ec78d1a3e079ec7a4b0b2821c71d5cfd1e51954", "ja": "あっ、ホントだ！　もうこんな時間じゃん。\nんじゃ、今日のところは帰ろっか？", "zh": "啊，真的耶！都已经这么晚了。\n那今天就先回去吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_06_1025_008tak", "source_sha256": "4635cecfafb89b094fe304bf913a4f1621aa956651d4393bc5cc7c33d836b7e1", "ja": "では{$P$}、私達はこれにて。\n明日のレッスンも、引き続きよろしくお願い致します。", "zh": "那么，{$P$}，我们就先告辞了。明天的课程也请继续多多关照。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_06_1026_021mat", "source_sha256": "a9ecd5f5c39e0a9e27f75b5f5779f6e74dd7af99c82b75196d95cddae64e22a1", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまなのです。\nまた明日、なのです♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生辛苦了呢。\n明天见哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_06_1027_se", "source_sha256": "ec1af790cbe5a717d390a701e0d39fdb8669efd3b376f0195d6a366da2749d27", "ja": "パタン……", "zh": "磅……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_06_1028_p", "source_sha256": "44367b70458640aa42890ebb039e81fd55fe3d3df8a0f8c5939552cdf0afd734", "ja": "あれ、翼は帰らないのか？", "zh": "咦，翼不回去吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_06_1029_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e3a137482f25918c02ddda03b7887e66f042c65ec49f9311094832bda1765c1c", "ja": "わたしも帰りますよ～！　でも、その前に……。", "zh": "我也要回去了～！不过，在那之前……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_06_1030_016tsu", "source_sha256": "60cb7480a9474df3bdec9363f1a66e69035beb7fbff73f623493d6096d0636f3", "ja": "{$P$}さん、今日はありがとう\nございました！　心配かけちゃってごめんなさい。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，今天非常感谢\n您！让您担心了，对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_06_1031_p", "source_sha256": "042fdd7e576fd537cb66a76e88bb0ba391b4b770eb4e791d43ac5b5c42778f92", "ja": "うん。もう、ケンカはしないようにな！", "zh": "嗯。以后可别再吵架了啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_06_1032_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d9015a479a526b64f2d1432444169e35d0d03490f6d34077d545540c8eb23881", "ja": "は～い。\n……ねえねえ、{$P$}さん？", "zh": "好～。  \n……那个，{$P$}先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_06_1033_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b8d946ddb82db31bfbabb9c22441aedde082b279355643e4fff74d912e08a673", "ja": "仲間って、なんかすごいですね！", "zh": "伙伴之间的羁绊，感觉真是不可思议呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_06_1034_p", "source_sha256": "b50f0aa4eaa9cae634c08c1cd80c102b1dc60d84c33ac68e4835f7e9effbfad9", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。すごいな！", "zh": "啊，是啊。真了不起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_06_1035_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8a9ec8006eaa3ec684c1c694477d7c205784fd4bde508cceca4932375a73158d", "ja": "えへへ、それじゃ失礼しま～す！\nお疲れさまでした～。", "zh": "嘿嘿，那我就先告辞啦～！\n辛苦了～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_06_1036_p", "source_sha256": "7a92173d5d364fefd69596b437e554eacfe6958dd17f4baa5c607f5ad1cc9f64", "ja": "おやすみ、翼！　また明日！", "zh": "晚安，翼！明天见！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_06_1037_p", "source_sha256": "bc444cf0592dd454e76d02f0bd93df5b61609b76fae7c2f465291c9820e142cb", "ja": "（ぶつかり合いながら、前へ前へと……この4人なら\nきっと、劇場の魅力を存分に届けてくれるだろう！）", "zh": "（一边碰撞，一边不断向前……这4个人一定能把剧场的魅力充分传达给大家吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
